    "detailed_description": "Play music through your headset and Beat Biome will automatically pick it up, reacting to the beats and wavelengths!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a pretty small trip, but fun none the less. Enjoy several psychedelic environments, even create your own! Just play some music and chill out, maybe lie down or bust a move. It's up to you how to enjoy this, just keep an open mind and two open ears. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf this blows up I'll make some more content, but in the meantime leave your comments in a review or email me directly with any bugs/feedback/etc you have. I'm a single developer and just made this for fun, so please be understanding if I can't get to everything. Thanks, and enjoy!",
